# GitHub collapses a generated file's diff in a pull request's "Files changed", judging "generated" by this attribute
# or, without it, by Linguist's own heuristics. The database function files are generated (pnpm db:domain-model --out),
# but their diffs are how a schema pull request shows which lines of which function it changes (docs/adr/0068), so
# they are marked not generated, explicitly, and always show open. They are text with LF line ends in every checkout,
# whatever core.autocrlf says, since --check compares them byte for byte with what the generator writes
# (tools/test/function-files.test.ts).
packages/db/functions/*.sql linguist-generated=false text eol=lf
# A migration is text with LF line ends in every checkout too: migration 20261111090000's preflight compares the SHA-256
# of two function bodies as PostgreSQL stored them, which are the migration files' own bytes, line ends included.
packages/db/migrations/*.sql text eol=lf
